xt","value":"同样适用于 ","position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":1,"offset":1820},"end":{"line":71,"column":7,"offset":1826}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Associated Token","position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":7,"offset":1826},"end":{"line":71,"column":25,"offset":1844}}},{"type":"text","value":" 账户，通过宏创建 ","position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":25,"offset":1844},"end":{"line":71,"column":35,"offset":1854}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Associated Token","position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":35,"offset":1854},"end":{"line":71,"column":53,"offset":1872}}},{"type":"text","value":" 账户的方式与创建 ","position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":53,"offset":1872},"end":{"line":71,"column":63,"offset":1882}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Token","position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":63,"offset":1882},"end":{"line":71,"column":70,"offset":1889}}},{"type":"text","value":" 账户类似，唯一的区别在于约束条件，具体如下：","position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":70,"offset":1889},"end":{"line":71,"column":93,"offset":1912}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":71,"column":1,"offset":1820},"end":{"line":71,"column":93,"offset":1912}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"#[derive(Accounts)]\r\npub struct CreateToken<'info> {\r\n    #[account(mut)]\r\n    pub signer: Signer<'info>,\r\n    pub mint: Account<'info, Mint>,\r\n    #[account(\r\n        mut,\r\n        associated_token::mint = mint,\r\n        associated_token::authority = signer,\r\n    )]\r\n    pub token: Account<'info, TokenAccount>,\r\n    pub system_program: Program<'info, System>,\r\n    pub token_program: Program<'info, Token>,\r\n    pub associated_token_program: Program<'info, AssociatedToken>,\r\n}","position":{"start":{"line":73,"column":1,"offset":1916},"end":{"line":89,"column":4,"offset":2410}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-2"}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":89,"column":4,"offset":2410}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# The Token Program\r\n\r\n![SPL Token with Anchor](/graphics/course-banners/spl-token-with-anchor.png)\r\n\r\n在 Solana 上，所有与代币相关的操作都由 [SPL Token Program](https://github.com/solana-program/token) 和 [Token2022 Program](/zh-cn/courses/token-2022-program) 处理：这是 Solana 的原生代币框架，定义了所有代币的创建、管理和转移方式。\r\n\r\n这是一个单一的统一程序，处理整个网络中的所有代币操作，确保一致性和互操作性。\r\n\r\n> 在 Solana 上为所有代币提供单一统一接口的决定，创造了一种可以在所有 dApp（去中心化应用程序）和集成（如钱包等）中复制的简单实现。\r\n\r\n对于 Anchor，所有与代币相关的内容都可以在 `anchor-spl` crate 中找到。因此，在初始化了一个 `Anchor` 工作区后，我们可以这样做：\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncargo add anchor-spl\r\n```\r\n\r\n> 如果您不熟悉 Anchor，我们建议您先完成我们的 [Anchor 入门课程](/zh-cn/courses/introduction-to-anchor) 再继续。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"铸币账户和代币账户\" id=\"mint-and-token-accounts\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n如果您熟悉 `Anchor`，您会知道它们有一组宏，可以帮助用户抽象掉与初始化账户相关的许多复杂性。\r\n\r\n同样适用于 `Mint`、`Token` 和 `Associated Token` 账户。\r\n\r\n### 铸币账户\r\n\r\n得益于 `Anchor` 提供的宏，我们可以轻松创建一个 `Mint` 账户，如下所示：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n#[derive(Accounts)]\r\npub struct CreateMint<'info> {\r\n    #[account(mut)]\r\n    pub signer: Signer<'info>,\r\n    #[account(\r\n        init,\r\n        payer = signer,\r\n        mint::decimals = 6,\r\n        mint::authority = signer.key(),\r\n    )]\r\n    pub mint: Account<'info, Mint>,\r\n    pub system_program: Program<'info, System>,\r\n    pub token_program: Program<'info, Token>,\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 代币账户\r\n\r\n同样适用于 `Token` 账户。通过宏创建 `Token` 账户的方式如下：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n#[derive(Accounts)]\r\npub struct CreateToken<'info> {\r\n    #[account(mut)]\r\n    pub signer: Signer<'info>,\r\n    pub mint: Account<'info, Mint>,\r\n    #[account(\r\n        mut,\r\n        token::mint = mint,\r\n        token::authority = signer,\r\n    )]\r\n    pub token: Account<'info, TokenAccount>,\r\n    pub system_program: Program<'info, System>,\r\n    pub token_program: Program<'info, Token>,\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 关联代币账户\r\n\r\n同样适用于 `Associated Token` 账户，通过宏创建 `Associated Token` 账户的方式与创建 `Token` 账户类似，唯一的区别在于约束条件，具体如下：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n#[derive(Accounts)]\r\npub struct CreateToken<'info> {\r\n    #[account(mut)]\r\n    pub signer: Signer<'info>,\r\n    pub mint: Account<'info, Mint>,\r\n    #[account(\r\n        mut,\r\n        associated_token::mint = mint,\r\n        associated_token::authority = signer,\r\n    )]\r\n    pub token: Account<'info, TokenAccount>,\r\n    pub system_program: Program<'info, System>,\r\n    pub token_program: Program<'info, Token>,\r\n    pub associated_token_program: Program<'info, AssociatedToken>,\r\n}\r\n```","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"rust","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"#[derive("}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Accounts"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":")]"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"pub"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" struct"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" CreateMint"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"<'"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1;font-style:italic"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"info"}]},{"ty